<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Cash Memo - {{memoNo}}</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    @page { size: 640px 400px; margin: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #111;
      background: #fff;
      width: 640px;
      min-height: 400px;
      padding: 22px 26px 18px;
    }
    .header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid #111;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 8px; color: #767676; margin-top: 3px; }
    .firm-block { text-align: right; }
    .firm { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }
    .invoice-ref { font-size: 8px; color: #767676; margin-top: 3px; }
    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 5px;
      font-size: 7px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border: 1px solid #111;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .meta-strip {
      display: flex;
      border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .meta-cell { flex: 1; }
    .meta-cell-mid {
      flex: 1;
      border-left: 1px solid #e4e4e4;
      border-right: 1px solid #e4e4e4;
      padding: 0 10px;
      margin: 0 10px;
    }
    .meta-label {
      font-size: 7px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #afafaf;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }
    .meta-value { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; }
    .main-row { display: flex; }
    .main-left { flex: 1; padding-right: 14px; }
    .line { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 9px; }
    .line-label { font-weight: 700; margin-right: 6px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .underline {
      flex: 1;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #c4c4c4;
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      min-height: 14px;
    }
    .note-inline { font-size: 8px; color: #555; margin-left: 6px; flex-shrink: 1; }
    .settle-box {
      width: 200px;
      border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 10px;
      background: #fafafa;
    }
    .settle-title { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 7px; }
    .settle-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .settle-label { font-size: 8px; color: #767676; }
    .settle-value { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
    .settle-balance { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; }
    .settle-divider { margin-top: 4px; padding-top: 5px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e4; }
    .tip { font-size: 7.5px; color: #767676; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.4; }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e4;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .amount-box {
      display: flex;
      border: 1px solid #111;
      height: 24px;
      width: 130px;
    }
    .amount-prefix {
      width: 32px;
      background: #111;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 24px;
    }
    .amount-value {
      flex: 1;
      text-align: right;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 24px;
      padding-right: 8px;
    }
    .sig-row { display: flex; }
    .sig { width: 120px; text-align: center; margin-left: 18px; }
    .sig-line { border-top: 1px solid #111; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .sig-label { font-size: 7px; color: #767676; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <div>
      <div class="title">Cash Memo</div>
      <div class="subtitle">Advance receipt · Token for future purchases</div>
    </div>
    <div class="firm-block">
      <div class="firm">{{firmName}}</div>
      <div class="invoice-ref">Customer advance token</div>
      <div class="status">Advance</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="meta-strip">
    <div class="meta-cell">
      <div class="meta-label">Challan No.</div>
      <div class="meta-value">{{memoNo}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta-cell-mid">
      <div class="meta-label">Date</div>
      <div class="meta-value">{{formattedDate}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta-cell">
      <div class="meta-label">Payment mode</div>
      <div class="meta-value">{{modeLabel}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="main-row">
    <div class="main-left">
      <div class="line">
        <span class="line-label">RECEIVED with thanks from</span>
        <span class="underline">{{customerName}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="line">
        <span class="line-label">the sum of Rupees</span>
        <span class="underline">{{amountWords}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="line">
        <span class="line-label">{{paymentLineLabel}}</span>
        <span class="underline">{{paymentLineValue}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="line">
        <span class="line-label">Dated</span>
        <span class="underline">{{formattedDate}}</span>
        <span class="note-inline">as a token of amount received</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tip">
        This cash memo is proof that the customer has deposited the amount above for future buying.
        Present it when billing against this credit.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="settle-box">
      <div class="settle-title">Amount received</div>
      <div class="settle-row">
        <span class="settle-label">Received</span>
        <span class="settle-value">{{amountFormatted}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="settle-row settle-divider">
        <span class="settle-balance">Credit for future buying</span>
        <span class="settle-balance">{{amountFormatted}}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div class="amount-box">
      <div class="amount-prefix">Rs.</div>
      <div class="amount-value">{{amountBoxValue}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sig-row">
      <div class="sig">
        <div class="sig-line"></div>
        <div class="sig-label">Signature of customer</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sig">
        <div class="sig-line"></div>
        <div class="sig-label">Signature of retailer</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
